# Rust build cache. This was tracked, which churned ~200 files on every build
# and shipped 1137 files in the 0.1.1 tarball. The npm `files` allowlist ships
# native-rust/src, build.rs, Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock -- the inputs needed to
# build from source -- so nothing here belongs in git or in the package.
native-rust/target/
